@startuml
title Branch flow

rectangle "feat/*" as F
rectangle "dev" as D
rectangle "main" as M

F --> D : PR + Stages 1-2
D --> M : human PR + Stage 5 deploy

note right of F
  Frontier plan/apply on push
end note
note right of D
  Integration
  GitHub: require PR
end note
note right of M
  Production
  GitHub: require PR
end note
@enduml
